; A price directive, an N directive, a commodity directive and an
; --exchange COMMODITY=PRICE expression each name a commodity no posting
; has used yet; commodity_pool_t::find_or_create creates it on first use,
; and the directive's effect lands on it.  (A basket price directive does
; the same; value-expr-basket-order.test pins that one.)

P 2024/01/01 ZZA 2.00 EUR
N ZZD
P 2024/01/01 ZZD 3.00 EUR
P 2024/01/01 ZZF 5.00 EUR

commodity ZZE
    format 1.000 ZZE

P 2024/01/01 ZZE 0.50 EUR

2024/01/02 Buy
    Assets:Broker      10 ZZA
    Assets:Cash      5.00 EUR
    Holdings:Other      2 ZZE
    Equity:Opening

test prices
2024/01/01 ZZA          2.00 EUR
2024/01/01 ZZE          0.50 EUR
2024/01/01 ZZF          5.00 EUR
end test

test bal Assets -X EUR --now 2024/01/03
           25.00 EUR  Assets
           20.00 EUR    Broker
            5.00 EUR    Cash
--------------------
           25.00 EUR
end test

test bal Holdings
           2.000 ZZE  Holdings:Other
end test

test reg Broker --exchange 'ZZC=4.00 EUR' --now 2024/01/03
24-Jan-02 Buy                   Assets:Broker                10 ZZA       10 ZZA
24-Jan-03 Commodities revalued  <Revalued>                        0         ZZC5
end test
